{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": "新吾", "steam": "新吾"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "新吾"}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "「好了好了我知道了！\\n　总之你先冷静下来——」", "steam": "“我知道了、我知道了啦！总之冷静下来，来，纱凪──”"}, "length": {"chs": 24, "steam": 26}, "similarity": 0.537}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "……虽然花了不少时间，\\n但我们总算打扫完活动室，离开了学校。", "steam": "……虽然花了很多时间，但我们总算把社团教室打扫干净，离开了学校。"}, "length": {"chs": 31, "steam": 32}, "similarity": 0.717}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "纱凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn7495", "steam": "sn7495", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「唉……打扫这么久，要是因为味道暴露了，那可就没脸见人了」", "steam": "“唉……要是结果因为气味被发现的话就太悲惨了。”"}, "length": {"chs": 29, "steam": 24}, "similarity": 0.381}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": "新吾", "steam": "新吾"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "新吾"}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "「以防万一，我已经通过风了，\\n　我想应该没问题吧……」", "steam": "“已经开窗换气过了，我想应该没问题……”"}, "length": {"chs": 28, "steam": 20}, "similarity": 0.611}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "纱凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn7496", "steam": "sn7496", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「既然已经把能做的都做了，应该没事吧」", "steam": "“好吧，反正能做的都做了，应该没事。”"}, "length": {"chs": 19, "steam": 19}, "similarity": 0.733}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "纱凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn7497", "steam": "sn7497", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「如果暴露了，嘿嘿嘿，\\n　你也会负起责任来吧」", "steam": "“就算真的被发现，嘻嘻嘻，新吾也会负责任嘛。”"}, "length": {"chs": 24, "steam": 23}, "similarity": 0.27}
